        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Program Bootstrapper Phase\n    A[Start App: Program.cs] --&gt; B[Create .NET Generic Host &amp; DI Container]\n    B --&gt; C[Register Services: Singleton&lt;Player&gt; &amp; Transient&lt;GameEngine&gt;]\n    C --&gt; D[Resolve GameEngine &amp; Call Run Method]\n\n    %% Game Engine Initialization\n    D --&gt; E[GameEngine.Run]\n    E --&gt; F[Console: Display Title &amp; Prompt for Player Name]\n    F --&gt; G[Read User Input -&gt; Set _player.Name]\n    G --&gt; H[Display Intro Message &amp; Wait for Keypress]\n\n    %% Dungeon Main Loop\n    H --&gt; I[Load Dungeon Rooms via _dungeonLoader]\n    I --&gt; J{More Rooms Available?}\n    \n    %% Room Loop\n    J -- Yes --&gt; K[PlayRoom: Display Room Title, Theme &amp; Enemy Count]\n    J -- No --&gt; L[Victory Screen: Dungeon Cleared!]\n    \n    %% Enemy Iteration inside a Room\n    K --&gt; M{Any Enemies Left in Room?}\n    M -- Yes --&gt; N[Instantiate Current Foe Clone]\n    M -- No --&gt; O[Room Completed -&gt; Advance to Next Room]\n    O --&gt; J\n\n    %% Combat Encounter\n    N --&gt; P[_encounters.Combat]\n    P --&gt; Q{Player Action Loop}\n    \n    %% Combat Actions\n    Q --&gt;|Attack / Heal / Use Potion| R[Calculate Damage / Status Change]\n    R --&gt; S{Enemy Health &lt;= 0?}\n    \n    %% Enemy Defeated\n    S -- Yes --&gt; T[Award Coins &amp; Drop Loot]\n    T --&gt; U[Increment enemyIndex -&gt; Next Enemy]\n    U --&gt; M\n    \n    %% Enemy Alive -&gt; Retaliates\n    S -- No --&gt; V[Enemy Attacks Player]\n    V --&gt; W{Player Health &lt;= 0?}\n    W -- Yes --&gt; X[Game Over: Player Died]\n    W -- No --&gt; Q\n\n    %% Player Runs Away\n    Q --&gt;|Run Away: &#39;R&#39;| Y[Combat Returns false: won = false]\n    Y --&gt; Z[PlayRoom checks !won]\n    Z --&gt; AA[Trigger SafeHallway]\n\n    %% Safe Hallway Sub-Loop\n    subgraph Safe Hallway Loop\n        AA --&gt; AB[SafeAlcove Menu: Heal, Buy Potion, or Exit]\n        AB --&gt; AC{Player Choice}\n        AC -- \&quot;1: Rest &amp; Heal\&quot; --&gt; AD[Deduct Coins, Add Health] --&gt; AB\n        AC -- \&quot;2: Buy Potion\&quot; --&gt; AE[Deduct Coins, Add Potion] --&gt; AB\n        AC -- \&quot;3: Return to Dungeon\&quot; --&gt; AF[Break SafeHallway Loop]\n    end\n\n    AF --&gt; N\n\n    %% Terminal States\n    X --&gt; AG[End Program]\n    L --&gt; AG&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="5EAPmoPjgv_thoLlGxS8-1">
